WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
- There are always gems to discover

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.180
when you scroll through social media

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.650
and I bring you the best, hopefully.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.893
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.893 --> 00:00:08.975
(rock music)

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.400
It's something most of us
probably don't even think about,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.780
but there are too many kids

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.870
who lack one of the most
basic needs: underwear.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.520
And for kids it can be mortifying.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.800
And that's why one Houston
woman has led the charge

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.780
to get drawers to children in need.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.920
We have her on the line right now

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.050
watching on Fox 26 Houston.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:28.410
From Undies For everyone,
everybody say hello to Amy.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.632
What's up, Amy?

00:00:29.632 --> 00:00:30.987
(audience cheering)

00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:32.670
- Hi, everybody.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.503
- Hi.

00:00:33.503 --> 00:00:34.336
So like I said

00:00:34.336 --> 00:00:36.360
this isn't something
many people think about.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.220
So how did you discover this need?

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:42.540
- It was in 2008 and a
social worker told me

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.730
about kids who got things donated to them

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:49.710
like clothes and backpacks,
but nobody gave underwear.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.590
And so, I created Undies For Everyone

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.260
to address this basic need.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.570
We just feel like this is something

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.030
that has a big impact at school.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:03.870
It affects the kids'
confidence and self-esteem.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.120
We don't want them to miss a day

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.490
of what they can learn at school.

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:12.240
We don't want them to be
embarrassed or be bullied.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.180
School really leads kids to
success and we know that.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:17.490
So underwear is a basic dignity

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:18.900
that a lot of us take for granted,

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.700
but really everyone deserves.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.612
- Absolutely, and you also make sure

00:01:22.612 --> 00:01:25.780
that even how they're
distributed is dignified, right?

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:29.520
- Yes, we never see the kids.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.490
We never follow up with the kids.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:34.920
We send them out through,

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.770
every school district
has a homeless department

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:42.000
and through Boys and Girls
Club, Child Protective Services,

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.280
pediatric mobile clinics,

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.040
and we have a whole army of volunteers

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.792
who roll and pack the underwear for us.

00:01:49.792 --> 00:01:54.060
Every kid gets seven pairs
of underwear, a full week.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:57.570
And to date, we've given away
5 million pair of underwear,

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:01.960
and next year alone we'll
give away 1.6 million pairs.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.050
(audience cheering)
- Wow.

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:05.580
Well thank you so much, Amy.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:06.690
That's incredible.

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:07.860
It's something we don't think about

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.060
but is such a necessity.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:09.893
So thank you so much.

00:02:09.893 --> 00:02:11.482
I'm liking your post right now, all right.

00:02:11.482 --> 00:02:13.860
(audience cheering)

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.540
And that's not all.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:16.373
That's not all, girl.

00:02:16.373 --> 00:02:18.870
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.760
the go-to pen of The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:24.240
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like yourself.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:27.600
So they're gonna give
Undies For Everyone $1,000

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.589
to help out.

00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:30.180
(audience cheering)

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.740
- Thank you so much.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:33.150
That's amazing.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:33.983
- Absolutely.

00:02:33.983 --> 00:02:35.790
Thank you so much, Amy,
for joining us today.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:36.803
And thank you to all our guests,

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.710
Zoey Deutch, Mike Rowe,
Jeannie Mai Jenkins,

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:44.370
Tyree Glasgow, Officer
Kim Erica Francis Wang,

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:48.236
Sheila Watco, and all of our
friends at NBC 10 Philadelphia.

00:02:48.236 --> 00:02:51.183
Y'all have a great day and if
it's not, try and change it.

